# A body ceiling is only right if it admits the largest body the endpoint
# accepts: a thousand legs at 64 characters a code, with a 500-character
# description, is 117,091 bytes.

title: the body ceiling is under the largest entry the endpoint takes
file: internal/ledgerhttp/transactions.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestTheLargestEntryTheEndpointTakesIsInsideTheBodyCeiling -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
const maxTransactionBody = 256 << 10
--- after
const maxTransactionBody = 64 << 10
